# graphify knowledge graph
# Track the portable outputs (graph.json, graph.html, GRAPH_REPORT.md, cost.json,
# .graphify_labels.json) so the graph is available to everyone. Ignore the
# machine-specific runtime state (absolute paths, mtimes) and the regenerable cache.
graphify-out/.graphify_python
graphify-out/.graphify_root
graphify-out/manifest.json
graphify-out/cache/
